  "scope": {
    "full_convex_purity": "Every extreme density on a finite complex carrier has a normalized vector outer-product representative; no supplied rank-one witness and no restricted state set.",
    "same_auxiliary_carrier": "Every pair of full convex-pure joint densities on iota x alpha with equal actual discardRight marginal admits U:Matrix alpha alpha Complex satisfying both unitary identities and actual conjugation by I tensor U. Vector version fixes phi(i,a)=sum_b U(a,b)psi(i,b).",
    "rectangular_embedding": "For any rectangular J:Matrix beta alpha Complex with J^dagger J=I, an actual one-Kraus CPTP map acts on the auxiliary carrier, preserves the system marginal for every complex input matrix, and preserves full convex purity of densities.",
    "different_auxiliary_carriers": "Actual left/right isometric inclusions into alpha Sum beta preserve full purity and marginal; the embedded purifications are related by an actual unitary on that common carrier.",
